{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSLink","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Layouts","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Navigations"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLink","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" proposes layout with text only or text with icon."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It also proposes layout to navigate forward or backward. The link can be displayed in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"small"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"default"},{"type":"text","text":" size."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Text-only-or-Text-and-icon-layout","level":2,"text":"Text only or Text and icon layout"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This layout is used to open a link or to display a specific feature (like send feedbacks, show more, …)"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Text only in small size, in compact density","    OUDSLink(text: \"Feedback\", size: .small, density: .compact) { \/* the action to process *\/ }","","    \/\/ From a localizable and a bundle","    OUDSLink(LocalizedStringKey(\"feedback_link\"), bundle: Bundle.module, size: .small) { }","","    \/\/ Text and icon in default size","    OUDSLink(text: \"Feedback\", image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(\"ic_heart\")), size: .default) { }","","    \/\/ Text and icon with raw image (not tinted)","    OUDSLink(text: \"Feedback\", image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(\"ic_brand\"), renderingMode: .original), size: .default) { }"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Navigation-layout","level":2,"text":"Navigation layout"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This layout is used to navigate backward, forward and outside the app"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Navigate to next page with link in a small size","    OUDSLink(text: \"Feedback\", indicator: .next, size: .small, density: .compact) { \/* the action to process *\/ }","","    \/\/ Navigate to previous page with link in a default size","    OUDSLink(text: \"Back\", indicator: .previous, size: .default) { \/* the action to process *\/ }","","    \/\/ The link takes full width but chevron stays just after the last character","    OUDSLink(text: \"See all\", indicator: .next, isFullWidth: true) { \/* the action to process *\/ }","","    \/\/ The link takes full width but indicator stays just after the last character","    OUDSLink(text: \"See all\", indicator: .external, isFullWidth: true) { \/* the action to process *\/ }",""],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the text must be to an edge, and the indicator on the other edge, the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSNavigationListItem"},{"type":"text","text":" should be used instead."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Colored-Surface","level":2,"text":"Colored Surface"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If link is placed on colored surface using "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSColoredSurface"},{"type":"text","text":", the default colors (content text and icon or arrow) are automatically adjusted to switch to monochrom."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Design-documentation","level":2,"text":"Design documentation"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-link","type":"reference","isActive":true}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":